  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/P1160786.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les bandes joves de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia d&#39;Onda (UMSCO) i de l&#39;Schola Cantorum de la Vall d&#39;Uix&oacute; han protagonitzat aquest diumenge un concert dins del XII programa d&#39;intecanvis musicals, despr&eacute;s de desfilar en cercavila des del Pla a l&#39;auditori de la societat.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160741.jpg\" alt=\"p1160741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160742.jpg\" alt=\"p1160742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160743.jpg\" alt=\"p1160743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160744.jpg\" alt=\"p1160744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160745.jpg\" alt=\"p1160745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160746.jpg\" alt=\"p1160746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160747.jpg\" alt=\"p1160747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadabandesjovesumscoscholacantorumlavall/p1160748.jpg\" alt=\"p1160748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;